{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master of Balance is a text-driven workplace survival adventure game where you'll take on the role of a junior executive at a gaming company who, after being caught up in a strange magical incident, he must discreetly handle the business of daily life and work while investigating the truth behind what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of daily random events, Carefully balance the values of the five dimensions of boss, subordinates, family, health, and money by choosing different responses, every choice may reverse the situation in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Storylines</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and witty main plot with different endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and addictive mini-game that can be played with just the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magical Abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of special abilities, free to mix and match, play in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This trial version contains a selection of characters and props from the official game, a mini-game and the first chapter of plot content.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701850?t=1746763396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701850?t=1746763396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701850/5c9a6d862c7014535ddd99959b2daef7f40c75cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746763396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701850/5c9a6d862c7014535ddd99959b2daef7f40c75cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746763396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>\u5173\u4e8e\u6211\u4eec</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more content updates and feedback, welcome to join the Discord group!</p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master of Balance is a text-driven workplace survival adventure game where you'll take on the role of a junior executive at a gaming company who, after being caught up in a strange magical incident, he must discreetly handle the business of daily life and work while investigating the truth behind what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of daily random events, Carefully balance the values of the five dimensions of boss, subordinates, family, health, and money by choosing different responses, every choice may reverse the situation in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Storylines</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and witty main plot with different endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and addictive mini-game that can be played with just the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magical Abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of special abilities, free to mix and match, play in your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This trial version contains a selection of characters and props from the official game, a mini-game and the first chapter of plot content.</strong></p>","developers":["NiniNana Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3583940","name":"Master of Balance"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701850/8fac6130b511f5567622029bc1a008225561e605/header.jpg?t=1746763396","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133202,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133202/movie480.mp4?t=1746675845","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133202/movie_max.mp4?t=1746675845"},"name":"DemoPV_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133202/9578ef6cb1453090909001a6a522b3db924fcb16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746675845","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133202/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746675845","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133202/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746675845"}}],"name":"Master of Balance Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windo