acb3544f03190cbc924ad6596ae0563b36a/ss_81cf1acb3544f03190cbc924ad6596ae0563b36a.600x338.jpg?t=1746763396"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701850/92436ea5308bd2bd4b766ef8f9ad58ee4fc6ec90/ss_92436ea5308bd2bd4b766ef8f9ad58ee4fc6ec90.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746763396","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701850/92436ea5308bd2bd4b766ef8f9ad58ee4fc6ec90/ss_92436ea5308bd2bd4b766ef8f9ad58ee4fc6ec90.600x338.jpg?t=1746763396"}],"short_description":"Are sudden promotions and superpowers a blessing or a curse? After an accident, your fate has been changed. Faced with eccentric bosses, difficult colleagues and relatives, the only way to keep the balance of life is to make careful choices so as to reclaim the initiative of your destiny.","steam_appid":3701850,"support_info":{"email":"1920509726@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}